<Positioned left="40" top="12"><Text fontSize="36" color="#FFFFFFFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">转化变化，为什么不能只看平均？</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="40" top="62"><Text fontSize="22" color="#94A3B8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">两个渠道的转化率都提高了，总体转化率却下降了 —— 一次构成变化（Simpson 型悖论）</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1150" top="14" width="410"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="21" color="#5EEAD4FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans Mono CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">conversion.csv · 两期各 10,000 次访问</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1150" top="46" width="410"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="22" color="#FBBF24FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">总体率 = 总成交 ÷ 总访问</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1150" top="72" width="410"><Container alignment="CENTER_RIGHT"><Text fontSize="20" color="#94A3B8FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">不使用渠道比例的算术平均</Text></Container></Positioned>
