<Positioned left="114" top="374"><Text fontSize="21" color="#0B7A6EFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">四条柱都变高：直接 30.00→35.00%，推广 10.00→12.00%</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="792" top="126"><Text fontSize="22" color="#0B1220FF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">② 两期访问构成</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="792" top="156"><Text fontSize="21" color="#5B6B7FFF" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" fontStyle="NORMAL">每期等长 = 100% 访问；绿=直接，橙=推广</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="792" top="188"><Container width="240" height="74" color="#0E9F8FFF"/></Positioned>
<Positioned left="1032" top="188"><Container width="60" height="74" color="#D97706FF"/></Positioned>
